        id: "if_97",
        on: "branch_if_97",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "s3_early_win",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Simyr",
            text: _("Alas, this is ill news indeed. A hero’s death, but a death nonetheless. Kaylan had hoped to send some of our number with you on your journey, but with his passing we can no longer afford to. Konrad, you will have to journey on from here with only Peasants and Woodsmen by your side."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_95",
        on: "branch_if_95",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "bm_kaylan_dead",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "sad.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Simyr",
            text: _("Victory is ours — but at such cost! Where is the lord of the town? What has become of Sir Kaylan?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Uncle Kaylan— <b>Sir</b> Kaylan fought bravely... but in the end he fell, pierced by Asheviere’s spears. It is thanks to his sacrifice that Blackwater Port still stands free."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_96",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_97",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_99",
        on: "branch_if_99",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "s3_early_win",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaylan",
            text: _("... and with the invading force so thoroughly defeated, I can afford to give you more riders than I had originally planned. Haldiel, step forward! I place your lance in the service of His Highness here. May you help him restore order to the country."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Haldiel",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "set_variable",
                name: "this_item.side",
                value: 1,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            id: "Haldiel",
            x: "$s3_konrad_position.x",
            y: "$s3_konrad_position.y",
            raw: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Haldiel",
            text: _("Greetings, young master. I pledge myself to your service."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_98",
        on: "branch_if_98",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "bm_kaylan_dead",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaylan",
            text: _("A glorious victory — thank you for your help, compatriots! I must remain here to safeguard the port, but with the false queen’s troops repelled many of my riders are free to accompany you on your quest. Konrad, may they serve you well!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:apply_object",
            object: "%7B%22id%22%3A%22%22%2C%22effects%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22abilities%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Konrad",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:allow_extra_recruit",
            id: "Konrad",
            types: "Cavalryman,Horseman",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_99",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_94",
        on: "victory_dance",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
